    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "3. Toss in the noodles and mix well."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "4. Add the soy sauce and kepac manis."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "5. Add the mustard leaves and beansprouts."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "6. Quickly stir in the eggs for a few seconds until set."
